      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0491-p0492:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                            Quillaja Saponaria Molina (nieht Molini).\n                                           Syn. Quillaja Smegmadermos D. C.\n\n                        Seifenbaum, Seifenrindenbaum —                        Panama —          Quillaia.\n\n           Familie:         Rosaceae (Unterfamilie: Quillajeae); Gattung: Quillaja Molina.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名 Quillaja Saponaria Molina，同義名 Quillaja Smegmadermos。屬薔薇科，俗名 Seifenbaum。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
      "source_locator": {
